    "text": "If <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mrow></math> and <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mrow></math> are the roots of the equation <math><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cot</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>A</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mi>sec</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cosec</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> must be",
